# EAS uses this file instead of .gitignore when present, so everything above
# is copied from .gitignore to avoid silently re-including node_modules etc.
# This is the one addition beyond .gitignore's own rules — .bun-cache is
# (unusually) tracked in git, but its huge symlink tree breaks EAS's project
# archive step on Windows and shouldn't be uploaded anyway (EAS installs
# dependencies fresh on its own build servers).
.bun-cache/
